@leisureyu/dsh-smart-dl README · 快速开始：```jsonc
smart_download({
  "targets": [
    { "url": "https://example.com/a.iso", "output": "a.iso" },
    { "url": "https://example.com/b.iso", "sha256": "…" }

**后台执行** —— 立即返回 `taskId`，不占会话，进度面板照常显示:

```jsonc
smart_download({ "url": "https://example.com/big.iso", "background": true })
// 用 download_status(taskId) 查进度;管理器里可取消 / 重试
```

@leisureyu/dsh-smart-dl README · Quick start：**A whole batch** — concurrent, capped, per-entry results; one failure never aborts the rest:

```jsonc
smart_download({
  "targets": [
    { "url": "https://example.com/a.iso", "output": "a.iso" },
    { "url": "https://example.com/b.iso", "sha256": "…" }

**In the background** — returns a `taskId` immediately; the panel shows it as usual:

@leisureyu/dsh-smart-dl README · Quick start：```jsonc
smart_download({ "url": "https://example.com/big.iso", "background": true })
// poll download_status(taskId); cancel / retry from the download manager
```
